# Lecture 13D

## Meiosis with Translocated Chromosomes

## Chapter 9

## Dr. Neil Voss

## December 8, 2026

=== layout: bookend

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Trace pairing of translocated chromosome homologs.
- Compare alternate, adjacent-1, and adjacent-2 segregation.
- Determine the gametes from each segregation pattern.
- Identify balanced and unbalanced gametes.

