# *Three Forms of Meiosis for Translocation Heterozygote*

@body

- chromosomes\:
  - [1\: transl.]{color=#FF00FF} with [red]{color=red} [centromere]{color=red}
  - 2\: normal with [blue centromere]{color=#0066FF}
  - 3\: normal with [red centromere]{color=red}
  - [4\: transl.]{color=#FF00FF} with [blue centromere]{color=#0066FF}
- Is this scenario 1 is pairing with both 2 and 3, but during cell division it can only go with one of the two.

