=== layout: one-panel

# *Balancing Translocation*

@body

- [*balanced translocation*]{underline=true} &#8211; non-homologous chromosomes interchange parts, but all parts are present
- [*unbalanced translocation*]{underline=true} &#8211; some or part of the genome is missing.
  - unbalanced gametes tend to lead to  arrested embryos, failed implantation or spontaneous abortion.

